Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: claude-usage-linux
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: panel tray indicator showing Claude usage
 Shows the Claude 5-hour and weekly usage as a dual-ring icon in the
 system tray (StatusNotifierItem/AppIndicator), with a menu giving
 progress bars and reset times for both windows.
 .
 Works on KDE, XFCE, Cinnamon, MATE and GNOME with the AppIndicator
 extension. Starts automatically at login.
